Every host: Daytona `f0611fa13` + EROFS-4k (#1060) + 30 s Firecracker socket wait (#3212) + the four create-path fixes behind
flags (section 6); Firecracker v1.16.1; daemon `rlp-rs-0.4.1`; balloon off; sandbox 1 vCPU, 0.025 CPU, 64 MiB; whole box,
unpinned. Startup client: `mpfleet.py` with 16 processes. Results below are with the fixes *on* unless stated.

